what: Implement a print view for the /reader page. The /reader experience is a standalone route outside the normal app layouts. It has no pagination and only rudimentary CSS. Markdown is not converted to HTML by the frontend; the backend returns a parsed gomark AST in `Memo.nodes`, and the frontend renders that AST through React components with Tailwind utility classes. Print CSS should be added to the reader-scoped plain CSS file, possibly plus global Tailwind print rules.

